This repository contains training recipes, data-prep scripts, and Automodel
drop-ins used to LoRA-SFT NVIDIA Nemotron-3-Ultra.

Training itself is driven by NVIDIA NeMo Automodel:

  https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel
  container: nvcr.io/nvidia/nemo-automodel:26.06.00

Some YAML recipes in `configs/` are derived from Automodel's Nemotron
examples and retain NVIDIA's Apache-2.0 headers.

The super/ pipeline contains the Nemotron-3.5-Super full-SFT snapshot
prepared on October 6, 2026. patches/nemotron35-super-automodel.patch
is based on NVIDIA NeMo Automodel commit 8cb12a35b65eda421d8f1fa485c658eb06d22c76.
Model weights and checkpoint-bundled remote model code are not included.
